- Plus, one border on the left and one on the right.

So, total borders in width: 3 (between) + 2 (left and right) = 5 borders, each 2 inches.

Total width = 4*(2x) + 5*2 = 8x + 10

So, 10x + 6 = 8x + 10 → 2x = 4 → x = 2

