From x=10 +10t=5 => 10t= -5 => t= -0.5

Then y=10 +20*(-0.5)=10 -10=0. So yes, E=(5,0) lies on BD when B=(10,10).

Similarly, for B=(2,-6) and D=(20,30). Let's check if (5,0) lies on BD.

